AI-Powered Multilingual Chatbot for SHG Members

Project Overview

The AI-Powered Multilingual Chatbot for Self-Help Group (SHG) Members is a user-friendly application designed to provide personalized information and guidance to SHG members, particularly women in rural areas.

The system collects basic user details such as name, age, gender, state, district, occupation, monthly income range, area of assistance required, and preferred language. Based on the user's profile and question, the chatbot provides relevant guidance on government schemes, SHG loans, savings, financial literacy, entrepreneurship, training, and livelihood opportunities.

The application uses Google Gemini AI to understand user queries and generate simple and practical responses. It supports multiple languages including English, Tamil, Hindi, Telugu, Malayalam, and Kannada. The system also provides voice input and voice output for easier interaction.

Objectives

- Provide information and guidance to SHG members.
- Provide personalized responses based on user profile details.
- Support multiple Indian languages.
- Provide information about SHG loans and government schemes.
- Improve access to financial and livelihood information.
- Provide voice-based interaction for easier accessibility.
- Create a simple and user-friendly chatbot interface.

Features

SHG Member Profile
The application collects:

- Name
- Age
- Gender
- State
- District
- Occupation
- Monthly Income Range
- Required Assistance
- Preferred Language

AI Chatbot
The chatbot uses Google Gemini AI to answer questions related to:

- Government schemes
- SHG loans
- Savings
- Financial literacy
- Microfinance
- Entrepreneurship
- Livelihood opportunities
- Training
- Employment

Multilingual Support
The chatbot supports:

- English
- Tamil
- Hindi
- Telugu
- Malayalam
- Kannada

The user's preferred language is selected during profile creation and is used for the chatbot response.

Voice Input
Users can ask questions using their microphone through the SpeechRecognition library.

Voice Output
The chatbot can read the generated response aloud using Google Text-to-Speech (gTTS).

Chat History
Previous questions and chatbot responses are displayed in the conversation section.

Technologies Used

Technology and Purpose 
Python - Main programming language 
Streamlit - Web application interface 
Google Gemini AI - AI response generation 
Google GenAI - Gemini API integration 
Google Translator - Language translation 
LangDetect - Language detection 
SpeechRecognition - Voice input 
gTTS - Text-to-speech output 
python-dotenv - Environment variable management 
